{
  "id": 2658582,
  "name": "RA-Mix",
  "description": "<h1 id=\"ra-mix:-ri-mix-style-merge\"><span style=\"color:rgb(250, 82, 82)\">RA-Mix: Ri-Mix Style Merge</span></h1><p><strong>RA-mix was created for Phinjo\u2019s 26k follower celebration bounty. I was honored to take second place in the event, and with permission, I\u2019m now sharing the merge with the community. </strong><span class=\"MentionNode_mention__q78sK\" data-type=\"mention\" data-id=\"mention:1436826\" data-label=\"phinjo\">@phinjo</span></p><p><strong>Models used:</strong></p><p><strong>A-mix:</strong><br /><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://civitai.red/models/1692152/a-mix-illustrious\">https://civitai.red/models/1692152/a-mix-illustrious</a></p><p><strong>Ri-Mix Pi v2:</strong><br /><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://civitai.red/models/996495/ri-mix-pony-illustrious\">https://civitai.red/models/996495/ri-mix-pony-illustrious</a></p><p></p><h2 id=\"what-is-this-merge\">What is this merge?</h2><p>Ri-Mix Pi v2 has great painterly detail, strong backgrounds, good lighting, and more interesting composition. It also has a dynamic western influence that gives images a different feel from a standard clean anime checkpoint. The tradeoff is that the facial area can sometimes come out softer compared to the rest of the image.</p><p>With RA-mix, I tried to influence Ri-Mix Pi v2 with the cleaner anime style of A-mix while keeping the parts that made Ri-Mix interesting in the first place. The goal was not to erase Ri-Mix or turn it into a standard anime model, but to clean up the facial structure while keeping the painterly detail, background strength, lighting, and more dynamic composition.</p><p>RA-mix is basically my attempt to balance those two sides: the cleaner face and anime polish from A-mix, with the western-influenced composition, lighting, and painterly detail from Ri-Mix Pi v2.</p><p></p><p>There was a little bit of tuning for the final version I'm posting but I think it turned out nice. I'm very happy with it's img2img abilites, and it's color range is very nice when using it with this application.</p><p></p><p>I wrote a step by step compariosn of the checkpoint here:</p><p></p><p>I also made an article that breaksdown the process I used to make the bounty image for Phinjo's compatition here: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"ugc\" href=\"https://civitai.red/articles/30721/under-painting-in-ai-part-2\">https://civitai.red/articles/30721/under-painting-in-ai-part-2</a></p><p></p><p>\ud83d\udd27 <strong><u>Recommended Settings:</u></strong></p><p>A well-rounded setup for general SDXL prompting.</p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(250, 82, 82)\">Steps: 30</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(250, 82, 82)\">Sampler: euler_ancestral</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(250, 82, 82)\">Scheduler: karras</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(250, 82, 82)\">CFG (Guidance): 5</span></p>",
